 ### Changed
 - `REMIXAPI_VERSION` is now `0.1000.1` (was `0.1000.0`).
+
+## [0.1000.2]
+
+Merges upstream dxvk-remix `main` of 2026-11-14 (upstream API `0.6.11`). Additive:
+the runtime reads the new material fields only from clients that report
+`0.1000.2` or newer, and writes a `0.1000.0` or `0.1000.1` client only the
+interface it knows (the 41 functions up to `GetGameValue`), so their binaries
+keep working unchanged.
+
+### Added
+- remixapi_MaterialInfoOpaqueEXT and remixapi_MaterialInfoTranslucentEXT:
+  textureScrollRate, textureScrollAngle, textureScale_hasvalue,
+  textureScale_value, textureOffset, textureRotation (upstream 0.6.6)
+- remixapi_Interface.SetWaterSim and remixapi_Interface.AddWaterDisturbance,
+  appended after the fork's functions (upstream 0.6.11 appends them after
+  SetCameraMediumMaterial)
+- remixapi_WaterSimInfo, remixapi_WaterDisturbanceInfo,
+  remixapi_InstanceInfoParticleObjectPickingEXT,
+  remixapi_InstanceInfoParticleSpawnDistributionEXT,
+  remixapi_InstanceInfoParticleScreenSizeEXT, as struct types 29 to 33
+  (28 to 32 upstream, where the fork's types already stand)
+- REMIXAPI_INSTANCE_CATEGORY_BIT_SLUDGE as `1 << 28` (`1 << 27` upstream,
+  which the fork's LEGACY_EMISSIVE holds)
+- remixapi_dxvk_CopyRenderingOutputType values WORLD_POSITION_RAW,
+  TEXCOORDS_RAW, NORMAL_F32 and COVERAGE
+
+### Changed
+- `REMIXAPI_VERSION` is now `0.1000.2` (was `0.1000.1`).
+- remixapi_InitializeLibrary writes the part of remixapi_Interface that the
+  client's version knows, sized by `remixapi_version::clientInterfaceSize`.
